    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to tell if you mean i should just sit here and wait for the dark to come for me, or if you're saying there's a way to just... reach out and flip the switch myself. like, if i just take control and turn the last light off, would that be the way to find that peace you're talking about?",
